# Kokoro ONNX weights are NOT bundled into the repo.
#
# Transformers.js downloads them from Hugging Face
# (onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX) into the browser's IndexedDB on
# the user's first synthesis. The cache persists across sessions; only
# the very first generation pays the ~80 MB download cost.
#
# This directory exists so the path is stable for future offline-mode
# work. Do not commit ONNX weights here.
